                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mb-5">
        <div class="p-5 rounded-5 bg-dark text-white text-center shadow-lg position-relative overflow-hidden">
            <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Ready to Lead the <span class="text-warning">Corporate World?</span></h2>
            <p class="mb-4 opacity-75">Join the specialized batch for CS Executive (Both Modules). Limited seats for Jabalpur, Raipur & Indore students.</p>
            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-3">
                <a href="https://wa.me/919926821000" class="btn btn-executive px-5">Apply For Both Modules</a>
                <a href="tel:07714095300" class="btn btn-outline-warning rounded-pill px-5 fw-bold">Free Demo Class</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>